# The Neural Filters, Camera Raw, the Blur Gallery and the lens filters
# (plugins/filters-core: neural.rs, camera_raw.rs, blurgallery.rs,
# lens.rs). Keys are filter.<id>.name, filter.<id>.param.<key>,
# filter.<id>.choice.<value> and filter.<id>.msg.<what>, after the ids
# the plugins register; a label several of these filters share is
# filter.neural.param.<label>. Model names ("Depth (Depth Blur)") are
# the ones Manage Models shows and stay as they are.

